  <p id="c-chenshu-017-wangtong-and-wangmai:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangtong-and-wangmai:p001:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC">王通</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangtong-and-wangmai:p001:m0003" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC">公達</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。祖<persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangtong-and-wangmai:p001:m0014" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AB">份</persName>，梁左光祿大夫。父<persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangtong-and-wangmai:p001:m0024" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA">琳</persName>，司徒左長史。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-017-wangtong-and-wangmai:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangtong-and-wangmai:p002:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG">勱</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangtong-and-wangmai:p002:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG">公濟</persName>，<persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangtong-and-wangmai:p002:m0005" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC">通</persName>之弟也。</p>
</text>
